ect material for sealings of most of substances even at higher temperatures.","source":"R-FILLAMENTUM-Technical-Data-Sheet-Flexfill-TPE-90A","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q07682","text":"This material can be used for production of electrical and electronic equipment.","source":"R-FILLAMENTUM-Technical-Data-Sheet-Flexfill-TPE-90A","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q07683","text":"The filament complies with the requirements for food contact applications.","source":"R-FILLAMENTUM-Technical-Data-Sheet-Flexfill-TPE-90A","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q07684","text":"It is safe for applications in contact with skin or mucous membrane.","source":"R-FILLAMENTUM-Technical-Data-Sheet-Flexfill-TPE-90A","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]},{"topic":"Benefits","items":[{"id":"Q07673","text":"The main difference caused by the very different polymer base is in chemical resistance.","source":"R-FILLAMENTUM-Technical-Data-Sheet-Flexfill-TPE-90A","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q07674","text":"It has chemical resistance against wide range of substances.","source":"R-FILLAMENTUM-Technical-Data-Sheet-Flexfill-TPE-90A","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q07676","text":"This material has very low gas permeability.","source":"R-FILLAMENTUM-Technical-Data-Sheet-Flexfill-TPE-90A","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q07677","text":"This filament has great flexibility.","source":"R-FILLAMENTUM-Technical-Data-Sheet-Flexfill-TPE-90A","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]},{"topic":"Precision and tolerance","items":[{"id":"Q07685","text":"For flexible materials, Fillamentum can guarantee maximum deviation of diameter +/- 0,10 mm.","source":"R-FILLAMENTUM-Technical-Data-Sheet-Flexfill-TPE-90A","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q07686","text":"During the production, filament is made with the best stability of diameter, roundness and colour.","source":"R-FILLAMENTUM-Technical-Data-Sheet-Flexfill-TPE-90A","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]},{"topic":"Surface finish","items":[{"id":"Q07679","text":"The surface of material is very pleasant to touch.","source":"R-FILLAMENTUM-Technical-Data-Sheet-Flexfill-TPE-90A","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q07680","text":"Thanks to its great layer adhesion, the objects have very smooth surface.","source":"R-FILLAMENTUM-Technical-Data-Sheet-Flexfill-TPE-90A","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q07681","text":"This finish is great to avoid any sticking of dirt.","source":"R-FILLAMENTUM-Technical-Data-Sheet-Flexfill-TPE-90A","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]},{"topic":"Adhesion between layers","items":[{"id":"Q07678","text":"High tear resistance is insured thanks to good layer adhesion.","source":"R-FILLAMENTUM-Technical-Data-Sheet-Flexfill-TPE-90A","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]},{"topic":"Printing advice","items":[{"id":"Q07687","text":"Use brim for better bed adhesion.","source":"R-FILLAMENTUM-Technical-Data-Sheet-Flexfill-TPE-90A","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]}]},{"id":"G170-01","name":"Fabru Thermoplastic styrene block copolymer elastomer (TPS)","maker":"Fabru","variant":null,"diameter":null,"twins":[],"composition":null,"certifications":"Flammability (UL 94) V0 (p. 1, as printed; a typical value, not a certificate: verify grade, thickness and certificate)","availability":null,"claim":null,"values":[{"key":"density","id":"V011243","value":1220,"mark":"counted","why":null,"ann