ial-data-sheet-TPS-40D-purefil","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q05945","text":"TPS shows good resistance to weather condi+ons and many chemicals and is also skin-friendly, which is oFen used in medical technology and consumer goods.","source":"R-FABRU-10204-material-data-sheet-TPS-40D-purefil","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q05946","text":"In FDM 3D prin+ng, TPE-S convinces with its good adhesion to other plas+cs, especially on other styrene-based plas+cs, which also makes it interes+ng for dual extrusion prin+ng.","source":"R-FABRU-10204-material-data-sheet-TPS-40D-purefil","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q05948","text":"TPS offers a balanced combina+on of flexibility, adhesion and printability for a variety of applica+ons.","source":"R-FABRU-10204-material-data-sheet-TPS-40D-purefil","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q05949","text":"high elas+city","source":"R-FABRU-10204-material-data-sheet-TPS-40D-purefil","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q05950","text":"high reseXability","source":"R-FABRU-10204-material-data-sheet-TPS-40D-purefil","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q05951","text":"well suited for dual extrusion","source":"R-FABRU-10204-material-data-sheet-TPS-40D-purefil","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]},{"topic":"Pitfalls and limitations","items":[{"id":"Q05954","text":"Only printable with Direct Drive extruder","source":"R-FABRU-10204-material-data-sheet-TPS-40D-purefil","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q05955","text":"low print speed","source":"R-FABRU-10204-material-data-sheet-TPS-40D-purefil","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]},{"topic":"Surface finis