ic conditions not published."},{"id":"Q05334","text":"Machinery","source":"S-PEBA-eSUN-TPE-83A-Filament-TDS-V4-0","at":"p. 1: Applications, six bullets, published bullet/heading 4","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement","conditions":"Maker statement only; no application validation, exposure test or suitability established. Specific conditions not published."},{"id":"Q05335","text":"Electric products","source":"S-PEBA-eSUN-TPE-83A-Filament-TDS-V4-0","at":"p. 1: Applications, six bullets, published bullet/heading 5","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement","conditions":"Maker statement only; no application validation, exposure test or suitability established. Specific conditions not published."},{"id":"Q05336","text":"Sporting goods","source":"S-PEBA-eSUN-TPE-83A-Filament-TDS-V4-0","at":"p. 1: Applications, six bullets, published bullet/heading 6","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement","conditions":"Maker statement only; no application validation, exposure test or suitability established. Specific conditions not published."}]},{"topic":"Benefits","items":[{"id":"Q08275","text":"Flexible TPE printing consumables with hardness of 83A are sturdy and durable; Printed models are softer than TPU-95A and eFlex, with delicate and soft hand feeling,also low surface friction.","source":"S-PEBA-eSUN-TPE-83A-Filament-TDS-V4-0","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q08277","text":"Sturdy and durable","source":"S-PEBA-eSUN-TPE-83A-Filament-TDS-V4-0","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q08278","text":"High impact resistance","source":"S-PEBA-eSUN-TPE-83A-Filament-TDS-V4-0","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q08280","text":"High elasticity","source":"S-PEBA-eSUN-TPE-83A-Filament-TDS-V4-0","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q08281","text":"Flexible and soft","source":"S-PEBA-eSUN-TPE-83A-Filament-TDS-V4-0","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q08282","text":"High tenacity","source":"S-PEBA-eSUN-TPE-83A-Filament-TDS-V4-0","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]},{"topic":"Surface finish","items":[{"id":"Q08276","text":"Matte surface effect","source":"S-PEBA-eSUN-TPE-83A-Filament-TDS-V4-0","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q08279","text":"Skin-friendly feel","source":"S-PEBA-eSUN-TPE-83A-Filament-TDS-V4-0","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]},{"topic":"Moisture sensitivity","items":[{"id":"Q08283","text":"it is recommended to dry the filaments (55℃/> 4h) before printing to achieve the best printing effect, and it would be better to use together with eBOX when printing.","source":"S-PEBA-eSUN-TPE-83A-Filament-TDS-V4-0","at":"p. 2","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]},{"topic":"Printing advice","items":[{"id":"Q08284","text":"It is recommended to use a short-range double-wheel deceleration extruder designed for flexibility, and eLastic materials cannot be printed by a remote extruder.","source":"S-PEBA-eSUN-TPE-83A-Filament-TDS-V4-0","at":"p. 2","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q08285","text":"After a long printing time, impurities may remain in the nozzle, so it is recommended to use it with cleaning filament.","source":"S-PEBA-eSUN-TPE-83A-Filament-TDS-V4-0","at":"p. 2","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q08286","text":"If necessary, pleasw replace the nozzle and throat with new ones.","source":"S-PEBA-eSUN-TPE-83A-Filament-TDS-V4-0","at":"p. 2","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]}]},{"id":"G167-11","name":"Fillamentum Flexfill TPE 96A","maker":"Fillamentum","variant":null,"diameter":null,"twins":[],"composition":"Polymer base polyolefin (