:"CN05"}},"ledger":{"tensileModulusXY":[{"rule":"CL01","kind":"ceiling","deciding":true,"level":"comparable","lo":null,"hi":0.5,"limit":{"lo":null,"hi":0.5}}]},"price":null,"notes":[{"topic":"Good for","items":[{"id":"Q07722","text":"This makes it perfect material for sealings of most of substances even at higher temperatures.","source":"R-FILLAMENTUM-Technical-Data-Sheet-Flexfill-TPE-96A","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q07728","text":"This material can be used for production of electrical and electronic equipment.","source":"R-FILLAMENTUM-Technical-Data-Sheet-Flexfill-TPE-96A","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q07729","text":"The filament complies with the requirements for food contact applications.","source":"R-FILLAMENTUM-Technical-Data-Sheet-Flexfill-TPE-96A","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]},{"topic":"Benefits","items":[{"id":"Q07720","text":"The main difference caused by the very different polymer base is in chemical resistance.","source":"R-FILLAMENTUM-Technical-Data-Sheet-Flexfill-TPE-96A","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q07721","text":"It has chemical resistance against wide range of substances.","source":"R-FILLAMENTUM-Technical-Data-Sheet-Flexfill-TPE-96A","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q07723","text":"This material has very low gas permeability.","source":"R-FILLAMENTUM-Technical-Data-Sheet-Flexfill-TPE-96A","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q07724","text":"The toughness of objects printed with 100% infill is similar as in case of Flexfill TPU.","source":"R-FILLAMENTUM-Technical-Data-Sheet-Flexfill-TPE-96A","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]},{"topic":"Precision and tolerance","items":[{"id":"Q07730","text":"For flexible materials, Fillamentu